  "system": {
    "props": {
      "availability_formula": "OWN_NUMEN_COUNT == 0",
      "availability_reason": "Numen already active",
      "class": "Illusionist",
      "cost": "50 MP",
      "description": "<p>You can now have up to <strong>4</strong> active Phantasms, but one of them must necessarily be <strong>Numen</strong>. Also, you cannot have more than one Numen Phantasm active at a time. This Phantasm cannot be used in any of the Illusionist’s Skills or Spells.</p>\n<p>Numen is bound by the same set of special rules as any other Phantasm, with the following exceptions:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Numen Phantasms cost <strong>50 MP</strong> to cast.</li>\n  <li>Numen’s Phantasmal Vitality equals <strong>twice your base Insight die size plus your level</strong>.</li>\n  <li>Once active, Numen acts at the <strong>end of your turn</strong>: it performs a <strong>free action</strong> — one Attack or Skill of its own — chosen and driven automatically. It holds no turn of its own, and does not benefit from Spells that grant additional actions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>When creating a Numen Phantasm you are prompted to choose one <strong>essence</strong>, which dictates Numen’s damage type for as long as it remains on the field:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Ravana</strong> — <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-id=\"XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;cursor:pointer;--content-link-background:rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:0;border:none;border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;position:relative;top:2px;text-shadow:rgb(153,153,153) 0 0 4px;font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Physical</span></strong></a></span></span></li>\n  <li><strong>Asura</strong> — <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.IQaK3IzvfFp4I1xB\" data-id=\"IQaK3IzvfFp4I1xB\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;cursor:pointer;--content-link-background:rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:0;border:none;border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;position:relative;top:2px;text-shadow:rgb(202,189,154) 0 0 4px;font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Light</span></strong></a></span></span></li>\n  <li><strong>Diablos</strong> — <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-id=\"vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;cursor:pointer;--content-link-background:rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:0;border:none;border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;position:relative;top:2px;text-shadow:rgb(182,102,210) 0 0 4px;font-size:14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Dark</span></strong></a></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The target hit by Numen suffers <strong>【HR + 14】</strong> damage.</p>\n<p>Damage dealt by Numen <strong>ignores Resistances and Immunities</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>range</strong> of the attack is determined by your current weapon.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><em>Numen’s Phantasmal Vitality, MP and damage are all derived from you at the moment of summoning — its own sheet holds only the unscaled baseline.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Skill Enhancement Lv. 20</strong> ― <em>Numen’s on-hit damage</em> increases to <strong>18</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Skill Enhancement Lv. 40</strong> ― <em>Numen’s on-hit damage</em> increases to <strong>20</strong>.</p>\n",
      "duration": "Scene",
